content.thinking:
The user asks about the standard library types table.

Key point: 这些不是语言自带的（不像 int/char），是标准库提供的，要 #include。

Difference from 派生数据类型:
- 内置类型 (int, char, double) — 语言自带，不用 include
- 派生类型 (数组、指针、结构体、类、枚举) — 你自己造的
- 标准库类型 (string, vector, map...) — 别人（官方）写好的类/模板

And "std::" prefix — they're in the std namespace.

Also: 这些其实是"模板"，要指定具体类型：`vector<int>`, `map<int, string>`.

Let me explain each briefly and demo.

Let me demo:
```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <array>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <utility>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    // string
    string s = "Hello";
    cout << "string: " << s << " 长度 " << s.size() << endl;

    // vector 动态数组
    vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3};
    v.push_back(4);                     // 能加
    cout << "vector: ";
    for (int x : v) cout << x << " ";
    cout << " 大小 " << v.size() << endl;

    // array 固定大小
    array<int, 3> a = {1, 2, 3};
    cout << "array: " << a[0] << " 大小固定 " << a.size() << endl;

    // pair
    pair<int, float> p(1, 2.0f);
    cout << "pair: " << p.first << ", " << p.second << endl;

    // map
    map<int, string> m;
    m[1001] = "小明";
    m[1002] = "小红";
    cout << "map: " << m[1001] << endl;

    // set
    set<int> st = {1, 2, 3};
    st.insert(2);                       // 已存在,不加
    st.insert(5);
    cout << "set: ";
    for (int x : st) cout << x << " ";
    cout << " <- 2 只有一份" << endl;
}
```

